              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.4+JER.52.5+JER.52.6+JER.52.7+JER.52.8+JER.52.9+JER.52.10+JER.52.11+JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "52.4-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore to lari le tomon aare le araroto ang, to lapa le tomon, te nkolong e imiet o lapa nelotu oltung'ani oisikua aing'uaa Yerusalem enatii nanu naajoki: “Etabatate enkanasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii apa enkaina o Laitoriani shumata nanu ina teipa eng'or elotunoto e ilo oisikua; netabolo ninye enkutuk ai te ina kata naewuo ilo tung'ani enatii tadekenya; metaa etaboloki apa enkutuk ai, nemeekure ara olemeiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ingot oo ltungana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
