          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii naajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, ore lelo oomanya kunen neetumutaki te nkop e Israel, nejoito; ore apa Abraham naa oltung'ani obo ake, kake enoto ninye aitaa ina kop enenye, nikira iyiook kumok, esipa tukul eishooki iyiook enkop maitaa enaang.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku, tiaaki ninche, inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Inyanya intae inkiri tenebo osarge, nidumakiki inkonyek inyi inkitanyaanyukot oo inkaitin inyi nemeishu, nimbukoo osarge; intokiki ake aaku iloopeny ena kop? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipikipiki ilo alem aaitaa osiligi linyi, niasiasa inolminong ore pooki ng'ae linyi neidurukie enkitok ole latia enye; ijojo iakuku iloopeny ena kop? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiaaki ena ninche, inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore anaa enaishu nanu, esipa tukul ajo ore lelo ootii iwuejitin neidaaitie naa kebatata to lalem; ore ilo otii enkong'ata naisiaja naa kaisho ninye ing'uesi entim meinosa, ore lelo ootii isempewueti o lootii nkapuniaa naa keye to lmeitai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa ina kop mitil naidaayie, ore ina golon enye nawuasare nebaiki enkiting'oto; ore lelo doinyo le Israel neaku mitili oleng metaa meetae hoo oloim empolos enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee eyilou aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani ina kata naitaa ina kop enkop mitil naitomijoon naa ene pesho te nkaraki nena baa olminong lenye pooki naataasa ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enataa to lkilikuai lo loiboni le Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te iyie, enkerai e tung'ani, ore iltung'ana linyi ooiro tenebo tenkaraki iyie too sunta, o too nkutukie oo nkajijik, ejokino ninche maate, pooki ng'ae ejoki olalashe lenye, ‘Wou sii iyietoning'o ajo kalo rorei ilo olotu aing'uaa Olaitoriani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu enitii anaa enapuonu iltung'ana enitii, netoni te dukuya intae anaa iltung'ana laainei; neinining ina nijo iyie kake meas ninche ina amu eibalunye oleng too nkutukie enye enyorrata sapuk, kake ore iltauja lenye netii atua dupoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa, ing'ura, itiu iyie te ninche anaa ilo oranyaki isinkolioitin le nyorrata, to ltoilo sidai oleng neosh te nkarriyiano e nkinanda, amu ening ninche ina nijo, kake meas ninche ina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie elotu ena, naa kelotu ninye, ina peyie eyiolou aajo etii apa oloiboni atua ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
